Package: com.ac3xx.lyricalizer
Name: Lyricalizer LRCLIB
Version: 1.4.2-lrclib4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Automatic lyrics for iOS 6: silent prefetch, LRCLIB exact/fuzzy matching, lyrics.ovh multi-source fallback, LrcAPI fallback, positive/negative cache, rate-limit handling, bundled TLS 1.2 and CA roots. Tracks with no lyrics leave the normal artwork untouched.
Maintainer: RaulKong89 community port
Author: ac3xx (original Lyricalizer), LRCLIB community backend
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 5.0), mobilesubstrate
Homepage: https://github.com/ac3xx/Lyricalizer
